# 文本统一以 LF 入库，检出时按各平台 core.autocrlf 处理，避免混合行尾
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换，也不参与差异对比
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.zstd binary
*.asar binary
